"When selected, layout will be published immediately, if it should be "
"published at a specific time, uncheck this checkbox and pick a date in the "
"field below"
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, la diapositiva se publicará de inmediato. Para publicarla en un "
"momento concreto, desmarque la casilla y elija una fecha en el campo de abajo"

