"When selected, your event will run according to the timezone set on the CMS, "
"otherwise the event will run at Display local time."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, el evento se ejecutará según la zona horaria del CMS; si no, a "
"la hora local de la pantalla."

msgid ""
"When set to Run Intent, which intent should be run. Format is: Action|"
"ExtraKey,ExtraMsg"
msgstr ""
"Con «Ejecutar intent», intent que se ejecutará. Formato: Acción|"
"ClaveExtra,MensajeExtra"

